{"id":"4b10db6d4361b2d2","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Transitive Closure By Sequence","display":"df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence — ZFC Set9 Transitive Closure By Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence — ZFC Set9 Transitive Closure By Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence — ZFC Set9 Transitive Closure By Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,x,c\\in V\">\\(T,x,c\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureBySequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureBySequence}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}by\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureBySequence}_S(T,x)\\leftrightarrow\nT=\\operatorname{TC}(x)\\land\n\\exists c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\\land c(0)=x\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(c(n+1)=\\bigcup c(n))\\land\nT=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}by\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureBySequence}_S(T,x)\\leftrightarrow\nT=\\operatorname{TC}(x)\\land\n\\exists c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\\land c(0)=x\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(c(n+1)=\\bigcup c(n))\\land\nT=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The iterated-union sequence is existentially bound, and its union is required to agree with the canonical transitive closure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TC}$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ are as in [[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TC}$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ are as in [[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,x,c\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureBySequence}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}closure\\text{-}by\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9TransitiveClosureBySequence}_S(T,x)\\leftrightarrow\nT=\\operatorname{TC}(x)\\land\n\\exists c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\\land c(0)=x\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(c(n+1)=\\bigcup c(n))\\land\nT=\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1229,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3467","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-set9-transitive-closure-by-sequence]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["8c8abfb908cc9a24","36d7463d215be751"]}